    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:41:23Z",
    "body": "Q2: I think (a) is probably better. It matches what `template for` patching does (keep comments and PIs unless they contain `</`), and it doesn't cripple PIs in SVG `title`: with (b), `svgTitle.setHTMLUnsafe(...)` couldn't create PIs.\n",
